{
  "blocks" : [
    {
      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-174461\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-174461\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>The required capacity in inches (mm) of the aisle for smoke-protected assembly seating shall be not less than the occupant load served by the egress element multiplied by the appropriate factor in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-174460', hash: '#JD_BCTable1029.6.2' }}\">Table 1029.6.2<\/Link> of this code. The total number of seats specified shall be those within the space and exposed to the same smoke-protected environment. Interpolation is permitted between the specific values shown. A life safety evaluation, complying with NFPA 101, shall be done for a facility utilizing the reduced width requirements of <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-174460', hash: '#JD_BCTable1029.6.2' }}\">Table 1029.6.2<\/Link> of this code for smoke-protected assembly seating subject to the approval by the commissioner.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-174462\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-174462\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Exception:<\/span> For outdoor smoke-protected assembly seating with an occupant load not greater than 18,000, the required capacity in inches (mm) shall be determined using the factors in Section 1029.6.3.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-174463\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-174463\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_BCTable1029.6.2\" id=\"JD_BCTable1029.6.2\" title=\"BC Table 1029.6.2\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 1029.6.2<br><\/br>Capacity for Aisles for Smoke-Protected Assembly<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-174464\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-174464\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
      "id" : "16363-html-1",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "The required capacity in inches (mm) of the aisle for smoke-protected assembly seating shall be not less than the occupant load served by the egress element multiplied by the appropriate factor in Table 1029.6.2 of this code. The total number of seats specified shall be those within the space and exposed to the same smoke-protected environment. Interpolation is permitted between the specific values shown. A life safety evaluation, complying with NFPA 101, shall be done for a facility utilizing the reduced width requirements of Table 1029.6.2 of this code for smoke-protected assembly seating subject to the approval by the commissioner.\n\n Exception: For outdoor smoke-protected assembly seating with an occupant load not greater than 18,000, the required capacity in inches (mm) shall be determined using the factors in Section 1029.6.3.\n\n Table 1029.6.2\n Capacity for Aisles for Smoke-Protected Assembly"
    },
    {
      "html" : "<table cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 768px&#10;                ;\"><colgroup><col width=\"25%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Total Number of Seats in the Smoke-Protected Assembly Seating<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Inches of Clear Width Per Seat Served<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Stepped aisles with handrails within 30 inches<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Stepped aisles without handrails within 30 inches<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Level aisles or ramped aisles not steeper than 1 in 10 in slope<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Ramped aisles steeper than 1 in 10 in slope<\/span>&#160;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:0.022in;padding-right:0.022in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">Equal to or less than 5,000<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:0.022in;padding-right:0.022in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">0.200 <\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:0.022in;padding-right:0.022in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-ali